OL,3,GNEWSAFrom JFK to Biden, Trump joins
OL,4,Awell-trodden path to the Emerald Isle
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Donald Trump lands in Dublin on
OL,7,FSaturday, he will be on a well-trodden
OL,8,Finternational path.
OL,10,FIn recent decades, Ireland has become a
OL,11,Fparticularly frequent fixture for US
OL,12,Fpresidential trips.
OL,14,FIt stands out among small countries as
OL,15,Fhosting a high number of visits.
OL,17,FThe bond between the two nations was
OL,18,Fforged by emigration, deepened by
OL,19,Feconomic ties, and cemented by the
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland peace process ` in
OL,21,Fwhich Washington played a major role.
